        {
          "text": "Ak ea adiidu ghoabwari gheawungeasu ghaydit ririnnyeanda, ak gajeakghaambiidan aba jeeda fuga Israeli; aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was dea amiineegwa; ",
